{%- comment -%}
  Site-wide fixes and extras, loaded on every page from the header group.
  1) Persian text fix: Dawn sets body { letter-spacing: 0.06rem }. Any letter-spacing breaks the joining of
     Persian letters, and in Safari/iOS it also breaks the order of text inside SVG charts. Never use it.
  2) Visual identity: assets/rz-theme.css (same tokens as the tools: near-black ground, antique gold, Vazirmatn + Fraunces).
  3) Install-as-app (PWA): manifest (/pages/manifest), home-screen icon, and a small install banner on phones.
  4) Speed (Nov 2026): tool pages are cached in the browser (rzLoad, stale-while-revalidate), the next page is
     prerendered when the visitor hovers or touches a link (speculation rules; tools start only when the page is
     actually shown, so no free-view quota or statistics are used by a prerender), lighter effects while scrolling.
  5) Right-to-left guard (Nov 2026): signed numbers (+7٪, −3.2%) and English company names ending in an
     abbreviation (NVIDIA Corp.) are isolated left-to-right so their sign or dot never jumps to the wrong side.
{%- endcomment -%}
